    03</ix:nonNumeric></span> <span id="xdx_902_edei--LocalPhoneNumber_c20230701__20240630_zVFCiJiN1Elg"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-07-01to2024-06-30" id="Fact000030" name="dei:LocalPhoneNumber">9882 0780</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></td></tr>
